sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant Credit as Credit Service
    participant Bureau as Bureau SDK
    participant DB as Credit DB
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant Kafka as Event Bus (Kafka)

    WF->>Credit: Perform credit/bureau check
    Credit->>Bureau: Fetch credit report from CRIF Highmark
    Bureau-->>Credit: Credit score, DPD, vintage, adverse flags
    Credit->>DB: Persist parsed bureau result
    Credit->>Outbox: Write event to outbox (same transaction)
    DB-->>Credit: Commit success
    Credit->>Kafka: Publish CREDIT_VERIFIED event
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Proceed to eligibility evaluation
